  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to contribute to the modernisation of the labour market organisation, activities and policy. The project consists if six components: statistics information/forecasting, dialogue, South Cacasus conference on labour market policy, active service at employment offices, project management.Partners are the Geor. Min. of Health/Labour/Soc. Affairs and Sw. National Labour Market Board.</narrative>
